{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26296","headline":"西蕃请谒庙 · 沈亚之","name":"西蕃请谒庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"肃肃层城里，巍巍祖庙清。\n圣恩覃布濩，异域献精诚。\n冠盖分行列，戎夷辨姓名。\n礼终齐百拜，心洁表忠贞。\n瑞气千重色，箫韶九奏声。\n杖移迎日转，旌动逐风轻。\n休运威仪正，年推俎豆盈。\n不才慙圣泽，空此望华缨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}